# Build context for own-article/cluster/Dockerfile.
#
# Without this the context is ~581 MB, of which ~551 MB is never used by the image:
# .git (225 MB), the reference-paper PDFs (228 MB) and the exploratory notebooks (98 MB).
# The Dockerfile only needs own-article/ source plus own-article/cluster/weather/.
#
# NOT excluded, deliberately: own-article/results_scenarios/. The legacy runners resolve
# `protocol_config.load_frozen_recipe()` against results_scenarios/recipe_frozen.json at
# RUNTIME, so dropping it would break run_multiseason/run_e3_seeds inside the image.
# (own-article/regen/ does not depend on it -- it fails loud on its own config instead.)

.git
.gitignore

# Reference PDFs and bibliography -- cited by the paper, never imported by the compute.
articles/

# Exploratory notebooks: superseded by the scripted runners, and the heaviest single item
# after .git and articles/ because outputs are committed inside them.
**/*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Manuscript sources and build products.
own-article/paper/
own-article/archive/

# Results already pulled off the cluster: the image produces results, it never reads these.
own-article/cluster/results_pull/

# Unrelated subprojects.
dashboard/
docs/
models/
tests/

# Local noise.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.tar
scratchpad/
